{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台凌晨4時發出黃色暴雨警告，西貢區及大嶼山雨勢特別大，部份地區出現水浸。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">其中在西貢蠔涌村，多條道路水浸，積水湧向路面，形同河流。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">而在市區，雨勢亦很大，不少車輛要減速慢駛。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.RAIN-0500_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026NR4uh2Aann1790978761.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.RAIN-0500_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台指，與高空擾動相關的強雷雨區正影響本港，視乎該雷雨區的發展，或需要發出紅色暴雨警告信號，而西貢區及大嶼山已錄得或預料會有每小時雨量超過70毫米的大雨，大雨可能引致山洪暴發，市民應遠離河道。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.RAIN-0500_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026LKUaCsiGri1790978778.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.RAIN-0500_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">渠務署呼籲市民，若發現街道水浸，應盡快致電熱線報告。勞工處提醒僱主及承建商，須採取適當安全措施，保障僱員的工作安全。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T22:39:33.919888+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}